WEBVTT

00:03.360 --> 00:06.120
The first time that I met Alice

00:06.120 --> 00:08.100
she was six years old.

00:08.110 --> 00:11.520
She suffered from 50 seizures a day.

00:11.520 --> 00:15.520
Her clinician couldn't find where to operate.

00:15.520 --> 00:18.360
This is why we developed our platform.

00:18.360 --> 00:22.400
It analyzed the neurodynamics

00:22.400 --> 00:25.240
and was able to identify the true

00:25.240 --> 00:28.000
drivers of her seizures,

00:28.000 --> 00:30.920
enabling the clinicians to eliminate all

00:30.920 --> 00:35.520
of her seizures from 50 (per day) to zero.

00:35.760 --> 00:39.440
Like Alice, there are 1.2 million people

00:39.440 --> 00:40.840
in the USA

00:40.840 --> 00:43.680
suffering from drug-resistant epilepsy,

00:43.680 --> 00:46.840
and their only hope is brain surgery.

00:46.840 --> 00:49.520
But half of the surgeries still fail to

00:49.520 --> 00:52.640
stop the seizures.

00:53.400 --> 00:55.680
We work with seven hospitals.

00:55.680 --> 00:58.920
We validated the algorithm.  We submitted an FDA (application).

00:58.920 --> 01:04.120
And soon we are going live with clinical utilization.

01:04.120 --> 01:08.080
So Alice, like my kids here,

01:08.080 --> 01:10.040
they are the same age.

01:10.040 --> 01:12.000
And this is why I built FIND Neuro,

01:12.000 --> 01:15.300
because every child deserves a healthy life.

01:15.320 --> 01:18.655
Thanks so much.

01:19.720 --> 01:23.040
And now it's my pleasure to announce the $25,000 award winner

01:23.040 --> 01:27.760
in the Alumni and Affiliates Healthcare and Life Sciences track.

01:27.760 --> 01:33.000
That goes to Noam Peled, FIND Neuro!
